    The array only exist if all the types can be registered as a metatype
    (detected using the TypesAreDeclaredMetaType helper struct): either they
    are declared as a metatype, or they are complete types (not non-const
    references) that QMetaType::fromType() can register automatically.
    If one of the type is not usable, the function return 0 and the types
    will be computed from the signal's signature when it is queued.
*/
